    ],
    "description": "Cross\nBallpoint Pen & Mechanical Pencil Set\nGold-Tone Metal, 2 Pieces\nClassic vintage Cross two-piece writing set featuring a ballpoint pen and matching mechanical pencil. Crafted in a lustrous gold-tone finish with fine linear ribbed detailing and signature black conical top accents. Cross writing instruments from this era are celebrated for their balanced weight and timeless design, making them enduring favorites for desk use and collectors alike.\nIncludes one ballpoint pen and one matching mechanical pencil\nGold-tone metal construction with classic vertical ribbed texture\nPocket clips feature engraved vintage cursive Cross script\nEach piece measures approximately 5.25 inches in length\nCondition:\nPre-owned vintage condition. Both pieces show light surface wear and minor micro-scratches consistent with gentle use. Gold-tone finish retains bright luster. Black cap accents and chrome tips are intact. Pen is untested for ink writing; pencil has lead extended as pictured.\nMerchandise is sold As Is. Returns will only be accepted with prior authorization and under the terms stated in this Return Policy. If you have questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item please contact Goodwill of Silicon Valley at 408-869-9262 prior to placing your bid. Items may be returned within seven (7) days of receipt if the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description. Returns will not be accepted without prior authorization. PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT REFUND SHIPPING AND HANDLING\nCHARGES. Items selected for pick up from the seller, must be picked up within thirty (30) days from close of auction. Items not picked up from seller within thirty (30) days from close of auction will be resold with no further\nnotice.\nLocal Pickup Policy\nAll items must be picked up within 30 days of purchase.\nAny item not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be resold without any prior notification.\nAll items picked up must be picked up by the individual named in the profile.\nNo 3rd party pickups without prior approval.\nIdentification is required to be shown when picking up all orders\nPayment for items not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be refunded automatically.\nAll pick-up orders must be paid for prior to pick-up. Payments will not be accepted on-site - no exceptions.\nNo Walk-Ins.\nIf you have not scheduled and received a confirmation of your pick up time, we will not be able to accommodate your pick up. Local pickup must be scheduled prior to arrival by calling Customer Service at 408-869-9262.\nThe pickup address for all items is 1600 Technology Drive, San Jose, CA 95110\nLocal pickup is available by appointment only and must be picked up within 30 days.",
